<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n35107" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔνδεια</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>want, lack</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δυνάμεως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					4.18
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς ἀναγκαιοτάτης διαίτης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					7.82
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Χρημάτων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Ath.</u>
					1.5
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Hp.Ma.</u>
				283d
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> abs.,
				<i>deficiency, defect</i>, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπερβολή</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Prt.</u>
				357b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>EN</u>
				1109a4
			</span></i>: pl., opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπερβολαί</span>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				2.33
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				8.90
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>want, need</i>, coupled with <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιθυμία</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Grg.</u>
				496d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				496e
			</span></i>: pl., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱ ἔνδειαι τῶν φίλων, τοῦ
				σώματος</span>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				8.2.22
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Erx.</u>
				401e
			</span></i>, al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>want of means, poverty</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀεὶ ἐνδείᾳ σύνοικος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Smp.</u>
					203d
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰσχρόν τι ποιεῖν δι᾽ ἔνδειαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					18.257
				</span></i>
			; <i>famine</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Jul.
				<u>Or.</u>
				2.66c
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b> Gramm.,
				<i>defect</i>, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλεόνασμα</span>, <i><span class="en">
				A.D.
				<u>Synt.</u>
				133.15
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
